sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Application / Runtime
  participant D as SQLite
  participant E as EventDelivery
  participant M as Main RuntimeClient
  participant R as Renderer
  A->>D: BEGIN：业务状态 + Event + Outbox
  D-->>A: COMMIT
  E->>D: 读取待投递 Outbox
  E->>E: EventProjector 投影严格 DTO
  E->>M: stdio JSON-RPC notification
  M->>M: 验证 Envelope 与载荷
  M->>R: typed IPC 通知
  E->>D: 记录投递结果
  Note over D,R: 投递失败保留记录；重启可重投
  R->>M: 刷新或重连后读取持久快照
  M->>A: JSON-RPC 读取
